cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite the manuscript and the archive DOI."
title: "Phi criterion: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, derived tables and figures for a dimensionless
  testability criterion for geophysical claims, Phi = MDE80 / claim. The
  criterion compares the 80 % verification floor of an observational archive
  with the accuracy the assessment asserts, using the standard deviation of the
  product-truth difference, the effective number of independent truth samples
  and the claim magnitude.
